WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Set to be transferred to Chaochang Technology Joint Research Center at a low price

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,800
So after deductions, the savings income this time will only be around 100 billion.

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,480
so-so

4
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:10,480
100 billion is still so-so

5
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:12,480
Ordinary people can’t make hundreds of millions in a few lifetimes

6
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:14,480
The top richest man in the country only has a net worth of 100 billion after working hard all his life.

7
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:17,480
It's not enough for him to bring back 100 billion worth of treasures in one trip.

8
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:19,480
The speed at which you make money is simply scarier than the money printing machine.

9
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:21,480
Brother Tong, we had a misunderstanding the first time we met.

10
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:23,480
You haven’t officially given me a meeting gift yet.

11
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:25,510
You girl want to starve me

12
00:00:25,510 --> 00:00:28,510
The misunderstanding has been explained clearly, yet this is still the case

13
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:30,510
I don't care, you took advantage of me anyway

14
00:00:30,510 --> 00:00:31,510
Just watch it

15
00:00:31,510 --> 00:00:36,150
OK, I'll give you a set of glass bracelets when the imperial green is unlocked.

16
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:38,150
Pair it with a top-quality diamond necklace

17
00:00:38,150 --> 00:00:42,510
How is it

18
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:43,510
Liu Qingqing, you are crazy

19
00:00:43,510 --> 00:00:46,540
That set of gestures would sell for at least tens of millions.

20
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:47,540
You really dare to accept it?

21
00:00:47,540 --> 00:00:49,540
This is not compensation, it is a gift budget

22
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:51,540
Who told you to recognize me just now?
